title: Future task extensions
tags: Tasks
kind: question
status: proposed
summary: An explicit acknowledgement freeing a result early, and query progress with real counts.

* ''Freeing a result early'': a `DELETE` of a finished task, for a client that wants the memory back before the retention time. The retention makes it unnecessary for correctness.
* ''Query progress'': a query reports no counts today. If the evaluator exposed checkpoints (per page, per operand), a query task could report a determinate progress.
